  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\"><br></span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/274A364B573185F102\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"561\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20160510_154132.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"561\"  id=\"A_274A364B573185F1020618\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2702D34A5731863213\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"563\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20160510_154149.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"563\"  id=\"A_2702D34A573186321373B7\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2702EF4A5731863412\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"557\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20160510_154205(2).jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"557\"  id=\"A_2702EF4A5731863412D8C5\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/24064A4A5731863611\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"576\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20160510_154242(2).jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"576\"  id=\"A_24064A4A5731863611E424\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>유인경 선생님 학습지에 있던 암석신문 만들기 했어요..</p><p>저희1학년 아이들이 쪼금 뛰어나서~~ 자랑하려고 올려요~~^^</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p></div><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
